<title>USA: Rite Aid names Franklin Brown vice chairman.</title>
<headline>Rite Aid names Franklin Brown vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>CAMP HILL, Pa. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rite Aid Corp said on Tuesday that it named Franklin Brown vice chairman.</p>
<p>Rite Aid said in a news release that Brown, currently its legal counsel and an executive vice president, added the vice chairman title earlier this month.</p>
